  "blocker": "Current importer mutates SYSTEM sync-query tracking fields during complete snapshot reconciliation.",
  "rootCause": {
    "file": "lib/data/catalogue/system_catalogue_snapshot.dart",
    "lines": "185-214",
    "mechanism": "During complete snapshot reconciliation, SystemCatalogueSnapshot.import iterated over all compiled snapshot collections and unconditionally executed an UPDATE on sync_queries WHERE scopeType = 'SYSTEM' AND collection = collection, mutating lastSyncedAt to LocalDataSource.now(), resetting lastError to null, updating catalogueVersion to releaseFingerprint, and overwriting cursor with readTimes[entry.key].",
    "consequence": "Any local snapshot installation or migration would silently mutate tracking timestamps, cursors, and backoff states of registered client sync queries, destroying historical sync state and causing spurious remote refetches or lost sync progress."
